Cell["\<\
The result is {h0, h1, v}. h0 has rows and columns in leadCell0; h1 has rows \
in leadCell0 and columns in leadCell1; v has rows in the last CSR layer and \
columns in leadCell0.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->836186689,ExpressionUUID->"19544c4c-1e9c-e643-ad1c-eb91ebb1d85e"],

Cell["\<\
The scattering-region layers are an ordered association; the last layer is \
the lead-contact layer. The underlying hopping cutoff must be a Real.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1577214147,ExpressionUUID->"fd772399-43cf-3543-a849-de846255b65c"],

Cell["\<\
Requires at least two CSR layers. Checks that leadCell0 does not couple to \
the penultimate layer and leadCell1 does not couple to the last layer, and \
prints leadName in diagnostics.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->381730293,ExpressionUUID->"e71fdad9-7150-934d-a456-34470af4f92f"]
}, Closed]],

